# The 3DS port, stage 3.4b: hooks for runtime/dsp.cpp's DSP lists behind the game (RE4_DSP_BEHIND): the voices'
# sync flags and depops go to the mixer, which keeps the sample-dependent state and runs the aux effects itself;
# the game changes the effects and aux callbacks only after the mixer is done with what it holds. Without
# RE4_DSP_BEHIND the hooks do nothing. A port patch.
